  "description": "ExChart: charts of the data an application shows in ExGrid, drawn as SVG elements Blazor diffs. Line, point and step charts on dates, numbers and categories, each series drawn as its Series Kind says, with a tooltip of every series at the pointer's position, a legend that hides a series, a drag that narrows the range, and an accessible summary and table; the application keeps what the user changed.",
